        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Prohibit",
      "cml:premiseText": "(3) Without limiting Division 2 of Part 5-2, an injunction granted under that Division may require a person responsible for keeping a list of defaulters or debtors on which the consumer’s name has been wrongly placed to remove the name from that list."
    },
