      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "...the inspector is not required to do so if: (b) the inspector is otherwise authorised (by a law, or an order of a court, of the Commonwealth or of a State or a Territory) to retain, destroy, dispose of or otherwise deal with the consumer goods or equipment.",
